          "worked": "Neither die shows $3$ in $5\\times5=25$ of the $36$ equally likely ordered outcomes.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{at least one 3})&=1-P(\\text{no 3})\\\\P(\\text{at least one 3})&=1-\\frac{25}{36}\\\\P(\\text{at least one 3})&=\\frac{11}{36}\\end{align*}$$",
